"First light" = "第一盏灯";
"Movement, reuse and recursion" = "移动、复用与递归";
"Move one cell forward. The robot starts facing up." = "向前走一格。机器人开始时面向上方。";
"The ring is directly ahead of the robot." = "圆环就在机器人的正前方。";
"One s is one forward move." = "一个 s 就是向前走一步。";
"Around the block" = "绕过石墙";
"Plan a detour around a wall; blocked moves stay in place." = "绕过墙壁规划路线；撞墙时机器人会留在原地。";
"The direct route is blocked. Look to the right of the wall." = "直线路线被堵住了，观察墙的右侧。";
"Try three segments: right, up, then left." = "把路线分成向右、向上、向左三段。";
"Square stamp" = "方形印章";
"Reuse a side-and-turn procedure four times." = "把走一边再转向的过程重复四次。";
"The four sides share one movement pattern." = "四条边共用同一段动作。";
"Put the right turn inside the procedure, after the steps." = "把右转放进过程里，接在前进指令后面。";
"A counted corner" = "数得清的拐角";
"Use a numeric parameter to walk two different distances." = "用数值参数控制两段不同长度的前进。";
"One segment is seven cells; the other is four." = "一段长七格，另一段长四格。";
"A recursive step counter can subtract 1 until the call is skipped." = "递归计步过程每次减 1，直到参数非正而跳过调用。";
"A reusable repeater" = "通用重复器";
"Combine a repetition count with an instruction parameter." = "把重复次数与指令参数组合起来。";
"Use one parameter for six repeats and another for a stair tile." = "一个参数表示重复六次，另一个表示阶梯单元。";
"Execute Y, then call the repeater with X-1 and the same Y." = "执行 Y，再用 X-1 和同一个 Y 调用重复器。";
"A growing thread" = "不断加长的线";
"Instructions and composition" = "指令参数与组合";
"Grow an instruction parameter by appending two steps." = "每次在指令参数后追加两步，让路径逐渐增长。";
"This spiral turns left and has lengths 2, 4, 6, and so on." = "这条螺旋每次左转，各段长 2、4、6……";
"Execute X, turn left, then pass Xss into the next call." = "执行 X、左转，再把 Xss 传给下一次调用。";
"Turning rose" = "旋转玫瑰";
"Grow a folded out-and-back instruction and rotate three sizes into four petals." = "让折叠往返的指令逐渐增长，再把三种尺寸旋转成四片花瓣。";
"Each folded branch returns to the center with its original heading." = "每条折叠分支都回到中心，并恢复原来的朝向。";
"Reuse X six times around the turns, grow X by one step, and rotate the complete three-size motif." = "在转向之间六次复用 X，每层增加一步，再旋转完整的三层图案。";
"Tandem lanterns" = "双灯相映";
"Compose a counted walk, a fourfold repeater, two lantern frames and their bridge." = "组合计步、四次重复器、两个灯框与连接它们的桥。";
"The two square frames have six-cell sides and share a straight lower bridge." = "两个方框的边长都是六格，底边由直桥连接。";
"Make the frame return to its starting pose, then use the counted walker to cross to its twin." = "让灯框过程恢复起点和朝向，再用计步过程走向另一个灯框。";
"Woven field" = "编织灯田";
"Use a finite row count and alternate the connector’s turn direction." = "用有限的行数控制灯田，并交替改变连接处的转向。";
"Each row is eight cells long; safe connectors are at the ends." = "每行长八格，安全的连接处在两端。";
"Adding rr to a turn parameter switches its effective direction." = "给转向参数增加 rr，可以切换它实际的转向方向。";
"Clockwork garden" = "发条花园";
"Combine counted repetition, shrinking squares and fourfold rotation." = "组合计数重复、逐渐缩小的正方形与四向旋转。";
"Each quadrant contains squares with sides 6, 4 and 2." = "每个象限中都有边长为 6、4、2 的正方形。";
"Build one square, recurse with X-2, then rotate the whole motif." = "先构造一个正方形，再用 X-2 递归，最后旋转整个图案。";
"Tidal locks" = "潮汐船闸";
"Let walls do the counting" = "让墙参与计数";
"Synchronize unequal lanes against walls, with a finite count and alternating turns." = "用墙对齐长短不同的通道，同时控制次数和交替转向。";
"The right banks retreat every two lanes; the left bank stays fixed." = "右岸每两行退进一次，左岸始终不变。";
"A long walk stops at each bank. Pass the turn as an instruction and reverse it for the next lane." = "足够长的前进会停在岸边。把转向作为指令参数，下一行反转它。";
"Resonant organ" = "共鸣管风琴";
"Reuse one out-and-back routine in six unequal walled pipes." = "让同一个往返过程适应六根长短不同的墙管。";
"Each pipe has a cap above and a shared stop below." = "每根管道上方有端盖，下方有共同的停止线。";
"Overrun in both directions, then move four cells sideways and restore the heading." = "出发和返回都可以多走；然后横移四格，恢复朝向。";
"Stepped cloister" = "层退回廊";
"Track two dimensions while a rectangular route contracts inward." = "用两个尺寸参数跟踪逐层向内收缩的长方形路径。";
"Opposite legs differ by two cells; a complete layer consumes four of each dimension." = "相对的两段相差两格；完整一层让两个尺寸各减四。";
"Separate the counted walk from a layer procedure with height and width parameters." = "把计步前进独立出来，再用高度、宽度两个参数定义一层。";
"Counterpoise" = "交错悬臂";
"Grow branches while alternating chirality and preserving a shared spine." = "让分支逐渐增长、左右交替，同时保持共用主干。";
"Five arms grow by two cells; their roots rise four cells each time." = "五根悬臂每次增长两格，根部每次上移四格。";
"Use count, length and turn parameters. Return to the spine before advancing its root." = "分别传递次数、长度和转向。先回到主干，再移动根部。";
"Gated pinwheel" = "闸门风车";
"Compose a bent arm that returns home facing the next rotated arm." = "组合弯折分支，让它回到中心时朝向下一条旋转分支。";
"Each arm has a long stem, a sideways gate and a short terminal passage." = "每条分支都有长主干、侧向闸门和末端短通道。";
"Name the counted walk and the complete arm separately; verify its final heading before fourfold reuse." = "分别命名计步和整条分支；重复四次之前，先检查结束朝向。";
"Braided stair" = "双线编阶";
"Reason about recursive state" = "推理递归状态";
"Swap two instruction arguments while the horizontal reach shrinks." = "水平跨度逐渐缩短时，交换两个指令参数。";
"Each rise is three cells; horizontal legs are 10, 8, 6, 4 and 2." = "每段上升三格，横段依次长 10、8、6、4、2。";
"Pass left and right turns separately, then exchange their parameter positions at the recursive call." = "把左右转分别传入，在递归调用时交换参数位置。";
"Counterweight stair" = "此消彼长";
"Change two numeric parameters in opposite directions, retrace the stair and rotate it four ways." = "让两个数值参数反向变化，原路折返阶梯后再做四向旋转。";
"Vertical legs shrink from four to one; horizontal legs grow from one to four. Four stairs share the center." = "纵段从四缩到一，横段从一增到四；四条阶梯共用中心。";
"Recurse with X-1 and Y+1, then undo the horizontal and vertical legs after the child returns." = "以 X-1、Y+1 递归；子调用返回后，依次撤销横段和纵段。";
"Hinged rosette" = "折页花窗";
"Use work after a recursive call to retrace a nested arm, then rotate it." = "用递归返回后的动作折返嵌套分支，再整体旋转。";
"The hooks shrink by two cells. Every nested call must return to its own starting pose." = "弯钩逐层缩短两格；每层调用都必须回到自己的起点和朝向。";
"Walk outward, turn into a smaller hook, then undo the turn and return before rotating the whole arm." = "先向外走，转进较小弯钩；返回后撤销转向、回到中心，再旋转整条分支。";
"Lantern boughs" = "灯树分杈";
"Visit both recursive children and restore the parent’s position and heading." = "依次遍历两个递归子分支，并恢复父分支的位置和朝向。";
"Each junction splits left and right; lengths fall 7, 5, 3, 1." = "每个节点向左右分杈，长度依次是 7、5、3、1。";
"A child routine must return home. Between children use a half turn, then retrace the parent stem." = "子过程必须原路返回；两次子调用之间掉头，最后折返父主干。";
"Contrary courts" = "相向庭院";
"Use mutually recursive procedures that exchange dimensions and turn direction." = "用相互递归的过程，交换尺寸并改变环绕方向。";
"Clockwise and counterclockwise rectangles share a corner, but exchange their long and short axes." = "顺、逆时针长方形共用角点，却交替交换长短轴。";
"Make two layer procedures call each other with the dimensions exchanged and reduced by two." = "写两个互相调用的层过程，传入交换后各减二的尺寸。";
"Lattice atelier" = "格窗工坊";
"Build patterns within patterns" = "图案中的图案";
"Nest a fourfold instruction repeater inside finite rows of reusable window tiles." = "把四次指令重复嵌入有限行数，复用整块窗格。";
"Sixteen windows form a four-by-four arrangement, linked along each lower edge." = "十六扇窗排成四行四列，沿每行下沿连接。";
"Separate walking, repetition, one window and one row. A row must return left before rising." = "区分计步、重复、单窗和整行；每行结束先返回左端，再上移。";
"Shifting registers" = "换位寄存";
"Exchange two numeric roles while alternating the connector’s turn." = "让两个数值参数交换职责，同时交替连接处转向。";
"Widths are 8, 4, 6, 2; gaps are 4, 6, 2, 4. Neither sequence changes monotonically." = "横宽为 8、4、6、2，间距为 4、6、2、4；两列都不是单调变化。";
"After a lane of X and a gap of Y, recurse with Y and X-2, plus the opposite turn." = "走完 X 长的横段和 Y 长的间隔后，用 Y、X-2 和反向转向递归。";
"Recursive lantern" = "递归灯宫";
"Assemble four rotated subcurves by swapping two turn parameters at each level." = "每层交换两个转向参数，把四条旋转子曲线拼成整体。";
"The passage has four similar quarters, each made from four smaller quarters." = "通道分成四个相似区域，每个区域又由四个更小区域组成。";
"Use depth and two opposite turns. The first and fourth subcalls exchange the turns; three two-cell links join them." = "传递深度和两个反向转向；第一、第四次子调用交换转向，用三段两格连接线拼合。";
"Snowmelt seal" = "融雪方印";
"Grow an instruction motif recursively, then execute only the selected expansion level." = "递归增长指令图案，但只执行指定层的展开结果。";
"Each straight segment becomes five segments with right, left, left, right turns. Four trap caps forbid overrunning the folds." = "每条直线替换成五段，转向依次为右、左、左、右；四个陷阱端点禁止在弯折处多走。";
"Carry the expanded instruction as a parameter. A second numeric guard selects the deepest layer before fourfold rotation." = "把展开后的指令作为参数传递，用第二个数值守卫选择最深一层，再做四向旋转。";
"Lantern atlas" = "灯窗图谱";
"Place four recursive copies at offsets, using depth and spacing as independent parameters." = "分别控制深度与间距，把四份递归图案放到偏移位置。";
"Four large corner groups contain four smaller groups; each connector must be retraced." = "四个大角组内各有四个小组，每段连接线都要折返。";
"Factor a corner trip that returns rotated by a quarter turn; repeat it four times and reduce spacing by three in each child." = "提取「走到角点再返回、净旋转四分之一圈」的过程；重复四次，子层间距减三。";
"Dragon gallery" = "龙曲画廊";
"Compose recursive systems" = "组合递归系统";
"Use two mutually recursive turns to generate a folding curve rather than a repeated tile." = "用两种相互递归的转向生成折叠曲线，而非重复单元。";
"The two halves have related folds, but their turns are ordered differently." = "前后两半的折叠相关，但转向排列不同。";
"One procedure expands A, right, B, walk, right; its partner expands left, walk, A, left, B." = "一个过程展开为 A、右、B、前进、右；另一个为左、前进、A、左、B。";
"Dragon compass" = "龙纹罗盘";
"Construct inverse recursive procedures so a folded curve returns before its next rotation." = "构造递归过程的逆过程，让折叠曲线折返后再旋转。";
"Four folded arms share a center. Finishing a curve does not automatically restore its starting pose." = "四条折叠分支共用中心；曲线结束并不会自动恢复起点和朝向。";
"Reverse the order of each recursive body and exchange left with right; surround the inverse trip with half turns." = "把各递归体的顺序倒过来、交换左右转；执行逆程前后分别掉头。";
"Chiral canopy" = "旋向树冠";
"Combine a branching return invariant with chirality passed through four recursive levels." = "结合分杈折返不变量与跨四层传递的旋向。";
"The same branch is reflected differently in its two children, then reused in four directions." = "同一分支的两个子分支采用不同镜像方式，再向四个方向复用。";
"Pass depth, stem length and a turn. Reverse the turn for one child; return to the parent pose after both children." = "传入深度、主干长度、转向；一个子分支反转旋向，两支结束后恢复父状态。";
"Vaulted mosaic" = "穹顶镶嵌";
"Nest window, row, shrinking tier and rotation routines, each with its own return invariant." = "嵌套单窗、整行、收缩层和旋转过程，各自保持折返不变量。";
"Each sector has three tiers: three large windows, two medium windows, one small window." = "每个扇区有三层：三扇大窗、两扇中窗、一扇小窗。";
"Let the row recurse sideways and unwind back; let the tier recurse upward and unwind down, then rotate the whole sector." = "整行向侧面递归、返回时折返；整层向上递归、返回时下行，最后旋转整个扇区。";
"Astral cathedral" = "星穹圣殿";
"Compose a window generator with a chiral branching tree and a higher-order rotation routine." = "把窗框生成器、带旋向的分杈树与高阶旋转过程组合成整体。";
"Every node is both a square courtyard and a branch junction; depth, size and chirality change independently." = "每个节点既是方形庭院也是分杈点；深度、尺寸与旋向分别变化。";
"Prove the courtyard and each subtree return to the same pose. Build one sector from those contracts, then pass it to a fourfold repeater." = "先确认庭院与每个子树都恢复原状态；按这个约定组合一个扇区，再交给四次重复器。";
